### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/health

### Echo, valid
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hei REST Clientistä!"
}

### Echo, invalid length
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### Echo, invalid type
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": 42
}

### Wrong route
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/missing

# Konsolipyyntö selaimesta (kutsu selaimen konsolissa)
const response = await fetch("http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/echo", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: {
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    message: "Hei selaimesta!"
  })
});
console.log(response.status);
console.log(await response.json());
